<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Land and Houses rated sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Land and Houses rated sell.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Equity Ltd on Friday reiterated its sell recommendation on Land and Houses Plc and said it had downgraded its outlook on earnings per share (EPS) for the company.</p>
<p>&quot;We are downgrading our forecast by approximately 11 percent and eight percent EPS growth in 1997 and 1998,&quot; Asia Equity said in a research report.</p>
</text>
